Changes to OCCT (V8_0_1) for the Open CAD Viewer. Applied by wasm/scripts/build-occt.sh.

- STEP: read the complex instance of NEXT_ASSEMBLY_USAGE_OCCURRENCE and
  QUANTIFIED_ASSEMBLY_COMPONENT_USAGE (PDM Schema Usage Guide 4.3, 4.1.2, Example 17) as the new
  StepRepr_QuantifiedNextAssemblyUsageOccurrence (835), a NAUO with the quantity. OCCT had no
  rule for it: the instance was an unknown entity and the component dropped out of its assembly
  (it showed as a loose root part instead).
- ReadNames names subtypes of NAUO too.

